      "content": {
        "block1": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "About EXIT-CVD",
          "content": "<div id='more'></div>The **EXIT-CVD** research consortium, co-funded by the **European Union Innovative Health Initiative (IHI)**, aims to transform how cardiovascular disease is detected, monitored and treated.\n<br />\nIt acts on three key exit points along the cardiac care journey:\n<br />\n<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin:8px 0'><div style='padding:14px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f7fd;border-left:3px solid #0078d4'><strong style='color:#0078d4'>Early Exit</strong> &mdash; Preventing disease through digital monitoring and early detection</div><div style='padding:14px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f7fd;border-left:3px solid #0078d4'><strong style='color:#0078d4'>Mid Exit</strong> &mdash; Reversing progression through personalised risk assessment</div><div style='padding:14px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f7fd;border-left:3px solid #0078d4'><strong style='color:#0078d4'>Late Exit</strong> &mdash; Halting progression with advanced therapies</div></div>"
        },
        "block2": {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "By the Numbers",
          "content": "<div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:8px'><div style='padding:20px;border-radius:10px;background:#fafafa;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:#0078d4;letter-spacing:-0.02em'>42</div><div style='font-size:0.85rem;color:#5a5a6a;margin-top:4px'>Partners</div></div><div style='padding:20px;border-radius:10px;background:#fafafa;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:#0078d4;letter-spacing:-0.02em'>17</div><div style='font-size:0.85rem;color:#5a5a6a;margin-top:4px'>Countries</div></div><div style='padding:20px;border-radius:10px;background:#fafafa;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:#0078d4;letter-spacing:-0.02em'>22</div><div style='font-size:0.85rem;color:#5a5a6a;margin-top:4px'>Clinical Studies</div></div><div style='padding:20px;border-radius:10px;background:#fafafa;text-align:center'><div style='font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:#0078d4;letter-spacing:-0.02em'>14k+</div><div style='font-size:0.85rem;color:#5a5a6a;margin-top:4px'>Patients</div></div></div>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "markdown",
      "noCard": true,
      "sx": {
        "width": "100%",
        "padding": "3rem 0",
        "bgcolor": "#fafbfc",
        "& .MuiTypography-h2": {
          "fontSize": "1.6rem",
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "color": "#1a1a2e",
          "letterSpacing": "-0.02em"
        },
        "& .MuiTypography-body1": {
          "fontSize": "0.975rem",
          "lineHeight": 1.75,
          "color": "#3a3a4a"
        }
      },
      "title": "Powered by Onsentia & RADAR-base",
      "content": "Onsentia powers the digital data collection and remote monitoring infrastructure for EXIT-CVD using the open-source **RADAR-base** platform.\n<br />\n<div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin:12px 0'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #eaeaea'><strong>Active monitoring (aRMT)</strong> &mdash; Patient-reported outcome questionnaires</div><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #eaeaea'><strong>Passive monitoring (pRMT)</strong> &mdash; Sensor and wearable data collection</div><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #eaeaea'><strong>Huawei D3 Watch</strong> &mdash; Ambulatory blood pressure monitoring</div></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "column",
      "noCard": true,
      "sx": {
        "width": "100%",
        "padding": "3rem 0",
        "bgcolor": "#ffffff",
        "& .MuiTypography-h2": {
          "fontSize": "1.4rem",
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "color": "#1a1a2e",
          "letterSpacing": "-0.02em"
        },
        "& .MuiTypography-body1": {
          "fontSize": "0.95rem",
          "lineHeight": 1.75,
          "color": "#3a3a4a"
        }
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "COMPASS Study",
          "content": "Led by **King's College London / GSTT**. Huawei Health provides ambulatory blood pressure monitoring via its D3 Watch. Onsentia's platform collects the data. MEGI delivers AI-powered cardiovascular assessments, and CogStack identifies participants from medical records."
        },
        {
          "blockType": "markdown",
          "title": "EMPOWER-BP Study",
          "content": "Led by **UMC Utrecht** with partners across Europe. Uses a citizen science approach with remote self-enrolment via social media and the Huawei D3 Watch, engaging patients directly in their health management."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockType": "markdown",
      "noCard": true,
      "sx": {
        "width": "100%",
        "padding": "3rem 0",
        "bgcolor": "#fafbfc",
        "& .MuiTypography-h2": {
          "fontSize": "1.6rem",
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "color": "#1a1a2e",
          "letterSpacing": "-0.02em"
        },
        "& .MuiTypography-body1": {
          "fontSize": "0.975rem",
          "lineHeight": 1.75,
          "color": "#3a3a4a"
        }
      },
      "title": "Innovation That Reaches Everyone",
      "content": "EXIT-CVD embeds **implementation science** and **equity-by-design** principles to ensure solutions are scalable, sustainable, and accessible to all populations &mdash; including those historically underserved.\n<br />\nA FAIR-compliant data platform aligned with the **European Health Data Space (EHDS)** supports integration, evaluation, and real-world scalability."
    },
    {
      "blockType": "accordion",
      "noCard": true,
      "sx": {
        "padding": "2rem 0",
        "bgcolor": "#ffffff",
        "& .MuiTypography-h2": {
          "fontSize": "1.6rem",
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "color": "#1a1a2e",
          "letterSpacing": "-0.02em"
        }
      },
      "title": "How to Participate",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "1. Check eligibility and provide consent",
          "content": "Complete a brief eligibility check, read the Participant Information Sheet, and sign an electronic consent form."
        },
        {
          "title": "2. Set up your study account",
          "content": "Create an account with your email and a password. Verify your email to proceed."
        },
        {
          "title": "3. Connect your devices",
          "content": "Connect the Huawei D3 Watch, install the RADAR Active App (aRMT) for questionnaires, and the RADAR Passive App (pRMT) for passive data collection."
        },
        {
          "title": "4. Participate in monitoring",
          "content": "Wear the Huawei D3 Watch as instructed, complete questionnaires via the Active App, and keep the Passive App running on your smartphone."
        }
      ]
    },
